            "stars_color": "#eac78b",
            "title": "Rejuvia's sleep spray has changed my life",
            "body": "<p>Rejuvia's sleep spray has changed my life....I am on the verge of menopause and have struggled with sleep for YEARS. I have tried literally everything. This is the first thing that has gotten me to fall asleep quickly and stay asleep throughout the entire night which has made every part of my life better...energy, mood, etc. Second, the customer service is AMAZING. I have never had any problems with the products until my last order in which some of the nozzles on the products didn't work. They responded to me quickly and immediately sent me replacements for the broken sprays. All around amazing company - I will be a customer for life.</p>",
            "author_name": "Kristen McNeany",
            "badge_type": "verified"
          }
        },
        "video_yypYhC": {
          "type": "video",
          "settings": {
