            "stars_color": "#eac78b",
            "title": "It helps me get to sleep",
            "body": "<p>I haven't been able to sleep for decades and have tried many sleeping pills and natural options. So what’s one more? I got this on their buy one get one free promotion. It actually does help me get to sleep within 10 or 15 minutes. I still can’t stay asleep, waking up after 3 or 4 hours. I do not feel energetic when I wake up, still as groggy as always. But for me it is worth the money to go to sleep instead of spending hours trying to sleep.</p>",
