            "answer": "<p>It's helped over 500,000 customers fall asleep faster and stay asleep, with 7,500+ verified 5-star reviews. Rejuvia's sublingual spray delivers 13+ natural sleep botanicals directly into your bloodstream under your tongue, so they go to work faster than a pill or gummy. And if it doesn't work for you, you're covered by our 90-day money-back guarantee.</p>"
