          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I've tried other sleep aids that didn't work. How is this different?",
            "answer": "<p>Most pills and gummies have to survive your stomach and liver, so you lose much of the dose before it ever reaches you. Rejuvia absorbs under your tongue, straight into your bloodstream, so more of the formula reaches you, faster. Many customers who'd \"tried everything\" say Rejuvia is the first thing that actually worked.</p>"
